{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2021-06-16 17:37:00', 'title': 'PUCO APPROVES THE AES OHIO SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT INCLUDING SMART GRID', 'text': "DAYTON, OHIO, JUNE 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AES OHIO, A SUBSIDIARY OF THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE: AES), ANNOUNCED A NEW MILESTONE IN ITS COMPREHENSIVE SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT THAT ENABLES THE DEPLOYMENT OF SMART GRID TECHNOLOGY FOR CUSTOMERS IN THE MIAMI VALLEY. TODAY, THE PUBLIC UTILITY COMMISSION OF OHIO (PUCO) ISSUED AN ORDER APPROVING AES OHIO'S AS FILED, NEARLY UNANIMOUS STIPULATION (STIPULATION)."}{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2021-06-16 14:22:00', 'title': 'IURC APPROVES AES INDIANA AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE 195-MEGAWATT SOLAR PROJECT IN CLINTON CO.', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JUNE 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AES INDIANA, A SUBSIDIARY OF THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE:\xa0AES), RECEIVED AN ORDER TODAY FROM THE INDIANA UTILITY REGULATORY COMMISSION (IURC) APPROVING THE COMPANY'S PLAN TO ACQUIRE THE HARDY HILLS 195-MEGAWATT SOLAR PROJECT IN CLINTON COUNTY, IND. THIS IS THE NEXT STEP IN AES INDIANA'S TRANSFORMATION TO DELIVER GREENER, SMARTER ENERGY SOLUTIONS."}{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2021-06-16 17:37:00', 'title': 'PUCO APPROVES THE AES OHIO SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT INCLUDING SMART GRID', 'text': "DAYTON, OHIO, JUNE 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AES OHIO, A SUBSIDIARY OF THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE: AES), ANNOUNCED A NEW MILESTONE IN ITS COMPREHENSIVE SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT THAT ENABLES THE DEPLOYMENT OF SMART GRID TECHNOLOGY FOR CUSTOMERS IN THE MIAMI VALLEY. TODAY, THE PUBLIC UTILITY COMMISSION OF OHIO (PUCO) ISSUED AN ORDER APPROVING AES OHIO'S AS FILED, NEARLY UNANIMOUS STIPULATION (STIPULATION)."}{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2021-06-16 14:22:00', 'title': 'IURC APPROVES AES INDIANA AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE 195-MEGAWATT SOLAR PROJECT IN CLINTON CO.', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, JUNE 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AES INDIANA, A SUBSIDIARY OF THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE:\xa0AES), RECEIVED AN ORDER TODAY FROM THE INDIANA UTILITY REGULATORY COMMISSION (IURC) APPROVING 